    "title": "World Postcard Day event planned",
    "text": "SOUTHWEST HARBOR — The Southwest Harbor Public Library will host a Postcrossing meetup and celebration of World Postcard Day with Noah Burby on Wednesday, Oct. 1, from 2-4:15 p.m.\nWorld Postcard Day marks the 156th anniversary of the mailing of the first postcard, “a practical means of sending brief communications” since 1869, according to organizers.",
